1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,962
He never stopped.

2
00:00:01,912 --> 00:00:03,937
And that’s why he won.

3
00:00:03,937 --> 00:00:06,362
So the real question is…

4
00:00:06,362 --> 00:00:08,137
Will YOU stop?

5
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:10,350
Or will you keep going?

6
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:12,312
Because your story…

7
00:00:12,312 --> 00:00:14,450
Is still being written.

